            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“K'ikwoŋo jacway ri Were i wi migam, aŋakin kodi bat wod rombo m'ioro ma kwoŋo womiyan paka mic ma welo aka wokethi gicen ri jacway ri Were i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adece no labedo ri Aron gi wote paka gima Joisiraili joripo timo, kole obedo adec pa jocway ri Were i wi migam ma Joisiraili jomiyo wok kwoŋ cowirok pajo ma siem, obedo mic pajo ri Rwoth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ruk pa Aron womiy wote joworuki ka go otho, joworuki k'ikwoŋo jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wod Aron m'olunji go paka jacway ri Were i wi migam aka ma donjo i Wema Maleŋ tiyo ran i Kabedo Maleŋ woruki ruk me ma ndelo abirio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwany riŋo ma wod rombo m'oor ma kwoŋo Aron gi wote aka itedi i Kabedo Maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowocami i dhiot ma Wema Maleŋ gi mugat m'odoŋ iy'adita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jowocami gi m'oor i kwer ma cwako i kwoŋo jo. Jocway ri Were i wi migam kende ama jowocami cemo me rupiri leŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka riŋo moro kosa mugat moro k'ocami tundo odikin, wowaŋ kiripi camo rupiri leŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tim kwer ma kwoŋirok me ri Aron gi wote ma ndelo abirio paka amiyin or. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisi ndelo iripo miyo thwon paka cowirok, ŋey reco wocwaki. Me bino lonyo migam. Kenyo iwir gi mo woloki maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tim gime kisi ndelo ma ndelo abirio. Kenyo migam bino bedo maleŋ kicutho, aka nyatoro kosa gimoro je m'ogey bino limo litho gi meni ma leŋo mere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29:37",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bino limo litho gi meni ma leŋo mere",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "I hongo no oyido nitie yeyo nike ji kosa gimoro nyalo limo litho gi geyo gimaleŋ",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mic ma kisi ndelo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kisi ndelo i hongo je, miy cowirok ma nyithindhi rombo ario ma wote ma jo oro acel i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miy cowirok ma nyathi rombo ma wode acel odikin, aka acel othieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gi nyathi rombo ma wode marapena miy bende kilo acel ma moko ŋano m'oruw gi lita acel mangil. Konji lita acel ma vini paka mic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miy cowirok ma nyathi rombo ma wode mar'ario gi gigipiny no bende paka odikin. Me mic ma cemo manyinge ran, Rwoth aka kur mere sangala an. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo je ma bino, mic awaŋa me iripo miyo ruwaŋan i dhiot ma Wema Maleŋ. Kenyo a kam'abino rom'iye gi ji paran t'aluwo gi jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo abino romo gi Joisiraili, aka abino loko jo maleŋ gi dwoŋ paran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abino loko Wema Maleŋ gi migam maleŋ, aka abino ketho gicen Aron gi wote tiyo ran paka jocway ri Were i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abino bedo i dier ji paran Joisiraili, aka abino bedo Were pajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobino ŋeyo ni Abedo Rwoth Were m'owodho jo wok i Misir ŋey abedi i dier jo. An abedo Rwoth Were pajo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
